# Compiled Rust binaries staged into the ISO overlay.
# These are BUILD ARTIFACTS, not source. The Dockerfile ENTRYPOINT installs both from
# /tmp/zohara-{settings,store}-rs/target/release/ into airootfs/usr/bin/ on every build (with
# `install -D`, so they do not need to pre-exist). Tracking them meant a ~3 MB ELF blob was added
# to history on every commit and `git status` showed a permanent ` M` after each build.
zohara-profile/airootfs/usr/bin/zohara-settings
zohara-profile/airootfs/usr/bin/zohara-store

# Large build logs and the prebuilt Docker image tarball (multi-GB, not source).
docker-*.log
zohara-builder-image.tar
.hermes/
